  <summary date="2026-10-28T15:37:35Z" status="Introduced in House">Protecting Older Americans Act of 2025

This bill prohibits a predispute arbitration agreement or predispute joint-action waiver from being valid or enforceable with respect to a case relating to an age discrimination dispute at the election of the person alleging the discrimination.</summary>
